Sound samples for the GBA's PCM audio (/dev/audio, /dev/audiost)
==================================================================

down15th.s8     mono,   8192 Hz, 8-bit signed PCM, about 24 s
down15th-st.s8  stereo, 8192 Hz, 8-bit signed PCM, interleaved L,R

Play them with

	cat /usr/share/examples/gba/down15th.s8 > /dev/audio
	cat /usr/share/examples/gba/down15th-st.s8 > /dev/audiost

(stereo is heard as such only on headphones or in an emulator; the
GBA's speaker is mono).

"down 15th street" by akelley6
